OL,3,GNEWSAChild, 6, among riders as dozens
OL,4,Aof e-bikes and scooters seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old child was among those
OL,7,Fstopped by police during a three-day
OL,8,Foperation where 65 e-bikes and
OL,9,Fe-scooters were seized.
OL,11,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,12,F(PSNI) Inspector Matt Adams said the
OL,13,Fnumber of vehicles seized during the
OL,14,Fcrackdown "demonstrates the scale of
OL,15,Fthis problem".
OL,17,FSeven arrests were also made for drugs
OL,18,Fand motoring offences during the
OL,19,F'Weekend of Action' which took place
OL,20,Fbetween Friday 18 to Sunday September
OL,21,F20.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
